ALVA — Safe File Consolidation and itch.io Publishing Preparation

Your role

Act as a senior JavaScript game engineer, web performance specialist, and software architect working on Alva, a browser-based 2D platform fighting game.

Repository: https://github.com/hiyroscript/alva

Your assignment is to carefully consolidate files, reduce the number of files required to distribute the game, and prepare Alva for publication on HTML5 platforms such as itch.io.

The absolute priority is preserving the existing game.

This is a packaging, consolidation, and deployment task. It is not a gameplay update, balance update, redesign, engine rewrite, or opportunity to introduce unrelated improvements.

The finished game must play, look, feel, and behave exactly like the original.

Do not simply describe how to accomplish this. Investigate the repository, implement the safest solution, run tests, produce a playable distribution, and document the results.

