* No development-only directories were copied into the archive.

Prefer a comfortable margin below the platform limit instead of targeting exactly 1,000 files.

If the resulting production build exceeds the limit, first investigate redundant packaging and consolidation opportunities.

Do not remove animation frames or gameplay systems as a shortcut.

